---

Note on the anonymized institutional data (data/, logs/): these files are
derived from real ITCM scheduling records with all personally identifiable
information removed (Section "Data Anonymization" in the README). They are
distributed under the same MIT terms for research and educational reuse;
re-identification attempts against the source institution are explicitly
discouraged and outside the intended use of this dataset.
